                         Pick
---------------------------------------------------------------------

Choose one visible, ordinary item from a mark's inventory and try to
steal it. Worn, wielded, kept, unique, auto-loading, protected, no-drop,
and otherwise unsafe items cannot be taken. A failed delivery leaves the
item and both inventories unchanged.

Successful theft from a suitable NPC can grant Thief GXP.

  GLVL: 6
  Syntax: pick <item> from <target>
